cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use a11ydebt, please cite the AISSA 2026 paper (preferred-citation below) and the software."
type: software
title: "a11ydebt: Audit Accessibility Debt in GUI-Agent Corpora"
abstract: >-
  a11ydebt measures content-description coverage, the share of UI elements that need a
  screen-reader label and have one, in the GUI corpora behind computer-use agents. It reports
  coverage per screen, per app and per corpus, with app-cluster bootstrap intervals. Version
  0.1.1 audits Rico and AndroidControl, and it reproduces the corpus coverage numbers and
  intervals of the IEEE AISSA 2026 paper exactly.
authors:
  - family-names: Kraishan
    given-names: Obada
    affiliation: "College of Media and Communication, Texas Tech University"
version: "0.1.1"
